{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2b97adc3-450f-830a-b747-87f67e36794c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T12:49:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony L. Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:46:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. Yeah, hi. I got a big tree down across the road, and I don't know who I'm supposed to call. Is it you guys, or the owner, or the electric company? Who handles that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:47:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get some details. Where's the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pelham Street, I'm at 26 Pelham, up on the Hill. It's right out in front. It came down this morning with the storm, the one that's hitting today. It's blocking both lanes, nobody can get by in either direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both lanes, got it. Writing that down. Is it touching any wires, do you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think there's a wire hanging off it, maybe, I can't tell from the window. I'm not going out there. Oh, and by the way, I'm on hold on another line, so if you hear a click, that's me getting beeped. I'm waiting on my landlord."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. If there's a wire down, stay well back from it. That one gets reported to the electric company too, but I'll put this in as a road blockage so a crew gets sent to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:48:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So that's the city, then? Because it's a tree in the street, but I think it came out of the yard next door. Does that matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, if it's in the roadway, the city gets it cleared so traffic can move. If it's off the road on private property, that's usually on the owner. And anything with the lines goes to the utility. So you might end up with a couple of different people out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:48:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Oh, and my car's parked on the street about three houses down. Is it gonna be okay, you think? Sorry, I'm jumping around. Back to the tree, it's a really big one, the trunk is wide as a barrel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Big trunk, both lanes, possible wire, Pelham Street. Is the car clear of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's past it, not under it. I just can't get it out right now. [pause] Sorry, was that a click? No, hang on. No, it's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:48:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all right. Do you want a call back when the crew's on the way? What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven oh. Got it. Crews are stretched with the storm still going, so it may be a while, and they'll hit the blocked roads first. This one qualifies, so it's near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if I see the wire sparking or something, I call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:49:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's sparking or anyone's in danger, call 911 first, then us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:49:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. Thanks, Kevin. Oh, that's the click, I gotta go. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T12:49:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Stay safe in there."
    }
  ],
